title: Jason_Found
---
Lona: Ha!
Lona: You should really pick better hiding spots.
Jason: Man. I really thought that was a good spot.
Lona: I guess I'm just better at this than you.
Jason: You spent ten minutes yesterday trying to figure out if you could hide behind the thorny bushes.
Lona: And I could.
Jason: Yeah… and then I had to explain to your mom why you had a bunch of tiny cuts all over your face.
Lona: What can I say, I like winning.
Jason: …
Lona: …
Lona: Okay my turn!
Jason: Okay, no more thorny bushes.
